    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 minute Commuting to school</strong>\u00a0is a 2D real-time attack (RTA) action game where players race to school while avoiding obstacles. The goal is to reach school as quickly as possible, trying again and again to get the fastest time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character wakes up almost late and hurries to school. Players can choose a bat to move slower but easier, or a bicycle to go faster but with more difficulty. The route is full of enemies, obstacles, and food items. Eating food raises the score, as the character skipped breakfast. There are many paths to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple controls and fast gameplay, the game is fun for both casual players and speedrunners. It is available for download on Steam.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 minute Commuting to school</strong>\u00a0is a 2D real-time attack (RTA) action game where players race to school while avoiding obstacles. The goal is to reach school as quickly as possible, trying again and again to get the fastest time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character wakes up almost late and hurries to school. Players can choose a bat to move slower but easier, or a bicycle to go faster but with more difficulty. The route is full of enemies, obstacles, and food items. Eating food raises the score, as the character skipped breakfast. There are many paths to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple controls and fast gameplay, the game is fun for both casual players and speedrunners. It is available for download on Steam.</p>",
